  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Bird Song**: rare: 12 archived performances [6]\n- **Steam Powered Aereo Plain**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [6]\n- **Degrees And Getting Colder**: rare: 7 archived performances [6]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **BS2019-01-24** (recommended): source not stated; 21 songs; 138 min; rated 3.5/5 by 4 [1]. Said about its sound: Chatter from audience members during the music is audible on the recording [5]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- A woman in the crowd repeatedly shouted a long, drawn-out \"yeah\", which the reviewer found irritating [3]\n- The crowd was very loud and energetic. One woman kept yelling \"yeah\", which this reviewer didn't mind [4]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **BS2019-01-24**: taped by Brain; transferred by Brain; source: AKG C568EBs> Sound Devices MixPre-6 [1]",
